                          QUERY PLAN                           
---------------------------------------------------------------
 Merge Append
   Sort Key: matest0.a
   ->  Index Only Scan using matest0_pkey on matest0 matest0_1
         Index Cond: (a < 100)
   ->  Sort
         Sort Key: matest0_2.a
         ->  Seq Scan on matest1 matest0_2
               Filter: (a < 100)
(8 rows)

