                             QUERY PLAN                             
--------------------------------------------------------------------
 Result
   InitPlan 1
     ->  Limit
           ->  Merge Append
                 Sort Key: a.unique1
                 ->  Index Only Scan using tenk1_unique1 on tenk1 a
                       Index Cond: (unique1 IS NOT NULL)
                 ->  Index Only Scan using tenk1_unique2 on tenk1 b
                       Index Cond: (unique2 IS NOT NULL)
(9 rows)

