 Result
   InitPlan 1
     ->  Limit
           ->  Index Only Scan using parted_minmax1i on parted_minmax1 parted_minmax
                 Index Cond: ((a IS NOT NULL) AND (b = '12345'::text))
   InitPlan 2
     ->  Limit
           ->  Index Only Scan Backward using parted_minmax1i on parted_minmax1 parted_minmax_1
                 Index Cond: ((a IS NOT NULL) AND (b = '12345'::text))
(9 rows)

